Compat before-patch for b6d536-search-budget-2-rag-repaired, applied to 900bdf4a0 (the parent of
the lane commit 7df6a0a7d that introduced the repaired behaviour; coordinator decisions 5 and 6).

Production, declarations and neutral defaults only; no production code in this state reads any of
them, and none supplies RAG budget behaviour:
- EmbeddingProvider.isAvailable() becomes a default returning true (abstract in this state). Every
  implementation in this state overrides it, so none of them changes; it lets the later test
  fixture, which implements availability() instead and reports READY, compile.
- EmbeddingProvider.availability() (a default returning READY) and the Availability record with its
  State enum and constants, the later availability snapshot the checks name.
- NoOpEmbeddingProvider.starting(), returning the existing INSTANCE: the provider this lane's checks
  used for models still loading (7df6a0a7d).
- RetrieveContextResponse.retrieval_mode_cause (proto field 11), which nothing in this state sets.

